    "rating": 4.3,
    "reference": "ChIJO6zOzus3yUwR0paHBgyJHwU",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Justin Senior",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104122725479843645816/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjGwmZ3Otjs7UTASH6KswxGWCc0gGP1PR6waPeTasbOO0lpHcs4A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "This is the BEST Prohibition PERIOD! Its not the same old head shop were used to in Quebec. This place is stocked with the latest innovative pieces, vaporizers, cleaning and maintenance gear, pipes, etc… The staff is super knowledgeable and Friendly. The owner is so devoted to his customers that if they don’t have something in the store, that you want, he’ll go out if his way to get it for you. Definitely worth a visit.",
        "time": 1655601605,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "John Locke",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105338901379965878972/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWWJMuD-C3Iy62xkGYlqXpA5pBZHiR7tQeaPyYD-QEf8GFy0Y0X=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I went here a few times but never again. I go in just to buy some rolling papers real quick but the employees just push the same products every time and insist on showing you all their stuff even when you say you are not interested. If you are not the first customer in there, expect to wait 10+ minutes just to buy a lighter or some filters. I only went there for quick service instead of ordering online but the high prices and wait time are not worth it. I find many of their products online for much cheaper.",
        "time": 1732438075,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Joe W",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107921765697451660135/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI3LdPQjnSSdrt_2x2vqOwU6-Oa8ojcKc_rLlPSIgXb3o-KfA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "This store actually has great products but I only go there as an absolute last resort because of how annoying and overzealous owner is. He is CONSTANTLY trying to either upsell you, sell you something you don’t want/need/didn’t ask for, also if you push back on anything he says, he gaslights you into thinking you don’t know as much as he does about your own experience.\n\nThe staff is trained to try to upsell you as well but that doesn’t actually bother me, I know they’re just doing their job and they back off if you say no thank you but the owner/manager or whoever he is is just an absolute nightmare to deal with. Even if I do cave in an go there maybe once or twice a year, I have to mentally prepare myself before waking in for the absolute bombardment of sales pressure mixed with one upping that will be foisted upon me for the crime of attempting to patronize this establishment without being harassed.\n\nThe funniest thing is, when I told my friend who also lives in the area about my experiences at this store, he has the EXACT same experiences and the exact same gripes about shopping here. I avoid this place as much as I can just to avoid the annoying and pushy owner and will only shop there as an absolute last resort and even then, I can’t walk in unless I have a spare 30 minutes to hear about how I’ve been doing it all wrong my whole life but not to worry because he’s going a solution he’s willing to sell me.\n\nTl:dr I want to walk in, buy what I came to buy, and walk out but the owner won’t shut up with the upselling and the general one upping of anything you say. Avoid avoid avoid. And if you think I’m wrong, go see for yourself.",
        "time": 1717686137,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michael Lapierre",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104943697679475092383/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWkASb2vpc5GQZhdDKxQaAYljJq8VI5ZouLzVdFXuSh8cljTLHOZg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The best shop around and the friendliest staff. Great hands on owner too. They have everything you could possibly need from incense and snacks to bongs and vapes. Support local, prices are more than fair!",
        "time": 1714170009,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kathleen Kelley",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100857954568596713491/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJUS-Hd14hlBF5a3oroZSI7KsI9Udl5XHASezSyDjQw6Me-gQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "The employee I originally dealt with was great but the owner is another story. Bought a spin ashtray only for the mechanism to no longer work 3 weeks later. When I called the store to see if they would replace it the owner told me no as he was not sure if it was dropped. The ashtray is glass and definitely wasn't dropped. The mechanism jammed but he refused to replace it. Horrible customer service. Will not be going back...ever.",
        "time": 1670386583,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
